cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "AI video model free-tier observations"
abstract: >-
  Dated observations of what twelve AI video models grant on their free tiers, one row per figure.
  Each row carries the channel it was observed on, the date it was observed, and whether the source
  was a vendor statement or a report. Where nothing is published, the row records the absence instead
  of a guess; no value is estimated or interpolated.
